{"title":"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/53196dddfbaf8145fd14be11cf568c5154588ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\nabla$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1f68e284bf2355ea02e09e7e478d12df8ed0d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\nabla b = 4a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/6/8d6913fdd2aa48fd3c7041343779c997aa0e29e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 \\nabla 2) \\nabla 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/9/9d9dee1fdad9c3d66d9f7010a6d0bb113ed068e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 21 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 22 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 30 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 88 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/9/4c91e4f23e78ea870170d52e6ce713846926ea3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\nabla 2 = 4 \\times 5 + 2 = 20 + 2 = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"247\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Next, we then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/d/43dabe56b4973a348efac4c1e18c285c8b0906a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 \\nabla 2) \\nabla 2 = 22 \\nabla 2 = 4 \\times 22 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"245\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b44cc03fe3cb0251fe3d737233a1344cfa32c350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=88 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff31325a85dcf911bbe2eecaf271a04d5df64b32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 90}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, giving:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/b/35b9320f9f9eb3966b91736ffc6a223d5ae879eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x \\nabla y) \\nabla y = (4x + y) \\nabla y = 4(4x + y) + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"321\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/2/9426054c4b1e9a86c47766ac99f533a4497b1b59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4 \\times 4x + 4 \\times y + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb0938acb54896b66006a3a64853c9fbb1c31af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=16x + 5y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> back in, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/f/9bfb1252a6ea94394f5e75afe35241e082c864fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 \\nabla 2) \\nabla 2 = 16 \\times 5 + 5 \\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"210\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62bd745acd4f73cc17656f36d0ce84daa63ce0d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=80 + 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff31325a85dcf911bbe2eecaf271a04d5df64b32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 90}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2024 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=